# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PoMiniGames .gitignore
# Authoritative list of files / directories that MUST NOT be committed.
# Organized by category so each rule is grep-able when triaging a new
# "untracked" file. Refactored per NET_CLEAN_10 §8 (workspace hygiene).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── .NET build outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Standard bin/obj outputs for every project + the .NET CLI folders.
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.log
*.nupkg
packages/
project.lock.json
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/

# ─── Runtime / framework caches ─────────────────────────────────────
# Files the host or framework writes at run-time (never commit).
# ASP.NET DataProtection key ring contains XML-wrapped key material that
# would let an attacker forge the BFF's auth cookies. Unanchored patterns cover
# every keys/ + logs/ dir wherever the host is run from (repo root or project dir).
# (The explicit src/PoMiniGames/ variants were removed 2026-08-18 — that project
# path no longer exists and the unanchored rules already covered it.)
keys/
keys/**
logs/
logs/**

# ─── IDE / editor state ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/
.vscode/mcp.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.lscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser
*.DotSettings.user

# ─── Test results / coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.trx
*.snap
# Verify writes *.received.* on a snapshot mismatch; only *.verified.* is committed.
*.received.*
test-results/
artifacts/

# ─── Playwright state ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.playwright-mcp/
.auth/
playwright-report/
playwright-report/**
blob-report/
blob-report/**

# ─── Adhoc screenshots / debug captures ──────────────────────────────
# SCREENSHOTS/ is where the old-vs-new UI captures land (CLAUDE.md); they are
# review artefacts, not source, so they stay local.
SCREENSHOTS/

# ─── Node / npm (npm-installed Azurite fallback writes here) ────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log

# ─── Local Azurite state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The npm-installed Azurite (when Docker isn't running) writes its
# on-disk state here. Container Azurite persists via the named volume
# in docker-compose.yml and never touches the working tree.
.azurite/
.azurite/**

# ─── Deployment artifacts (CI/CD + kudu + local publish) ─────────────
# Never source — generated by `dotnet publish`, `az webapp deploy`, or
# kudu ZIP push. Explicit names below were committed by mistake in
# commits 59dae1d and earlier; never source.
publish/
publish/**
publish-fix/
publish-fix/**
publish-api/
publish-api/**
client-trim-audit/
client-trim-audit/**
app-deploy.zip
app-deploy-fix.zip
api-deploy.zip
appservice-logs.zip
latest.zip
*.zip
!src/**/*.zip

# ─── Copilot / agent configuration ───────────────────────────────────
# Machine-local config that should never be in source control.
agentrc.config.json
agentrc.eval.json
cookbook/
instructions/
skills/
.copilot-session/

# ─── Environment / secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production

# ─── Azure CLI / azd local state ─────────────────────────────────────
.azd/
.azure/

# ─── SQLite runtime files (defensive — none today) ───────────────────
*.sqlite3
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ─── Generated documentation (Mermaid HTML export) ────────────────────
docs/*.html

# ─── Backup / temp files ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.orig
*.bak
*.tmp

# ─── OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.directory
.directory~
.hidden
.nfs*

# ─── Art sources ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Master renders kept locally for re-export only. The PoJoker Grandma portraits
# arrived as 21 × 1024² PNGs (21 MB); wwwroot ships the 512² WebP derivatives
# (~740 KB total) instead. Committing the masters would put 21 MB into every
# clone and every deploy package for pixels nothing renders.
# Re-export: ffmpeg -i "<name>.png" -vf scale=512:512:flags=lanczos \
#            -c:v libwebp -pix_fmt yuva420p -quality 82 grandma-<emotion>.webp
assets/

# PoVoxelStrike: converted voxel volumes are build product derived from the GLBs in
# the drop folder — regenerated on any API start. The drop folder itself IS source
# (authored GLBs ship with the app), so only the output is ignored.
src/PoMiniGames.API/App_Data/povoxelstrike/converted/

# The same scaffold at the REPO ROOT is pure runtime: PoVoxelStrike's AssetDropPath
# and ConvertedPath are relative, so launching the host with the repo root as the
# working directory (dotnet run from here, or a debugger profile) recreates the tree
# there. Nothing under it is source — the authored GLBs live under the API project.
/App_Data/

# Compiled ARM templates. infra/*.bicep is the source; `az bicep build` emits a
# same-named .json beside it. Three of those (alerts, kv-secrets, shared-rbac) were
# committed and went stale against their .bicep siblings — nothing deploys them,
# since deploy.yml passes main.bicep straight to `az deployment sub create`.
# main.parameters.json is NOT a build output (it is real deployment input), hence
# the negation below.
infra/*.json
!infra/main.parameters.json
